WEBVTT

00:02:00.782 --> 00:02:02.624
This was an experiment.

00:02:02.648 --> 00:02:03.958
I burnt a candle,

00:02:03.982 --> 00:02:07.259
built this contraption
that would suck in that candle soot,

00:02:07.283 --> 00:02:09.450
mixed it with some
vegetable oil and vodka,

00:02:09.474 --> 00:02:13.163
because to a DIY hacker,
these were really easily available.

00:02:13.188 --> 00:02:14.229
(Laughter)

00:02:14.254 --> 00:02:15.538
And after mixing them,

00:02:15.562 --> 00:02:18.498
you could churn out
a very rudimentary form of ink

00:02:18.522 --> 00:02:20.285
that would go into a cartridge,

00:02:20.309 --> 00:02:22.568
and now you could print with it.

00:02:22.592 --> 00:02:25.655
This was my "Hello, World!"
of experimenting

00:02:25.679 --> 00:02:27.300
with printing with pollution.

00:02:29.162 --> 00:02:32.138
This is the same pollution
that I showed you in the petri dish,